    "detailed_description": "<strong>EXCAVATE A WONDER</strong><br>An elite team of archeological excavators (And you) have landed on the mysterious Mezokorane, a ruin grasped between the edges of reality. While they rebuild a decrepid museum, you're left to wander. What secrets does this city harbour?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/e27fbac61aade1a396ab52de2d945b9b.poster.avif?t=1730561965\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/e27fbac61aade1a396ab52de2d945b9b.webm?t=1730561965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/e27fbac61aade1a396ab52de2d945b9b.mp4?t=1730561965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>GUARDED BY PUZZLES</strong><br>Discover new paths by solving hand-crafted conundrums that build upon each other. Learn through incremental experimentation and delve into the furthest reaches of this ravaged metropolis.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/74e3d332e7ee56ed0cf5336a2ee64302.poster.avif?t=1730561965\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/74e3d332e7ee56ed0cf5336a2ee64302.webm?t=1730561965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/74e3d332e7ee56ed0cf5336a2ee64302.mp4?t=1730561965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>SHROUDED IN MYSTERY</strong><br>Collect their stories, study their past and understand their tools. This world may be foreign to you, but they left instructions and you've got a pretty good translator app on your tablet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/46e3c6cb583418b4b92a40785da1d042.poster.avif?t=1730561965\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/46e3c6cb583418b4b92a40785da1d042.webm?t=1730561965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/46e3c6cb583418b4b92a40785da1d042.mp4?t=1730561965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
